# BAZAARPK — FINAL STAGE 1 DEVELOPMENT & PRODUCTION MASTER PROMPT

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade my existing BazaarPK Ecommerce & Admin Platform into a production-ready, multi-tenant Retail SaaS platform for Pakistani small and medium businesses.

IMPORTANT:
- Work on the existing project and existing source code.
- Do not unnecessarily rebuild the project from scratch.
- First inspect the complete existing codebase, architecture, Firebase configuration, routes, components, services, database structure, Firestore rules, Storage rules and existing functionality.
- Preserve working features and improve them.
- Do not remove existing functionality unless it is broken, insecure, redundant or explicitly replaced.
- Do not create fake functionality, fake analytics, mock API responses or demo data in production.
- All features must connect to real Firebase data.
- Do not claim a feature is completed unless it is implemented and tested.

The goal is to build a real SaaS business that can onboard multiple independent shops with their own accounts, products, inventory, orders, customers, branding, subscriptions and public online storefronts.

