IMPORTANT SUBSCRIPTION RULES:

1. All prices and limits must be editable by Super Admin.
2. Never hardcode plan limits in multiple components.
3. Use a centralized subscription and entitlement service.
4. Validate every feature permission and product limit on the backend.
5. Product limits must count active products, not deleted or archived products.
6. Prevent a shop from bypassing limits through direct Firestore requests.
7. If a subscription expires, apply the configured grace period and then restrict paid features.
8. Never automatically delete a shop's products or orders because of subscription expiry.
9. Downgrading must not delete existing data.
10. When a shop exceeds its new plan limit, prevent additional active products until the limit is satisfied or the shop upgrades.
11. Free plan must not expire automatically.
12. Support monthly and yearly billing options when configured by Super Admin.

